// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// Next-Gen Enterprise Payroll & HR Management System
// Prisma Schema — PostgreSQL
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

// ── Company ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
model Company {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  name        String   @db.VarChar(255)
  email       String   @unique @db.VarChar(255)
  phone       String?  @db.VarChar(20)
  address     String?  @db.Text
  city        String?  @db.VarChar(100)
  state       String?  @db.VarChar(100)
  country     String?  @db.VarChar(100)
  zipCode     String?  @db.VarChar(20) @map("zip_code")
  logo        String?  @db.Text
  industry    String?  @db.VarChar(100)
  taxId       String?  @db.VarChar(50)  @map("tax_id")
  isActive    Boolean  @default(true)   @map("is_active")
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())  @map("created_at")
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt       @map("updated_at")

  employees   Employee[]
  departments Department[]

  @@map("companies")
}

// ── Department ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
model Department {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  name        String   @db.VarChar(150)
  description String?  @db.Text
  companyId   String   @map("company_id")
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt      @map("updated_at")

  company     Company    @relation(fields: [companyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  employees   Employee[]

  @@map("departments")
}

// ── Employee ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
model Employee {
  id            String         @id @default(uuid())
  employeeCode  String         @unique @map("employee_code") @db.VarChar(20)
  firstName     String         @map("first_name") @db.VarChar(100)
  lastName      String         @map("last_name") @db.VarChar(100)
  email         String         @unique @db.VarChar(255)
  phone         String?        @db.VarChar(20)
  avatar        String?        @db.Text
  dateOfBirth   DateTime?      @map("date_of_birth")
  gender        Gender?
  role          EmployeeRole   @default(EMPLOYEE)
  designation   String?        @db.VarChar(150)
  baseSalary    Decimal        @map("base_salary") @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  bankAccount   String?        @map("bank_account") @db.VarChar(30)
  bankName      String?        @map("bank_name") @db.VarChar(150)
  panNumber     String?        @map("pan_number") @db.VarChar(20)
  joinDate      DateTime       @map("join_date")
  exitDate      DateTime?      @map("exit_date")
  isActive      Boolean        @default(true) @map("is_active")
  companyId     String         @map("company_id")
  departmentId  String?        @map("department_id")
  createdAt     DateTime       @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt     DateTime       @updatedAt      @map("updated_at")

  company       Company        @relation(fields: [companyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  department    Department?    @relation(fields: [departmentId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  attendance    Attendance[]
  payrolls      Payroll[]
  leaveBalances LeaveBalance[]

  @@index([companyId])
  @@index([departmentId])
  @@map("employees")
}

// ── Attendance ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
model Attendance {
  id          String           @id @default(uuid())
  employeeId  String           @map("employee_id")
  date        DateTime         @db.Date
  checkIn     DateTime?        @map("check_in")
  checkOut    DateTime?        @map("check_out")
  hoursWorked Decimal?         @map("hours_worked") @db.Decimal(5, 2)
  status      AttendanceStatus @default(PRESENT)
  notes       String?          @db.Text
  createdAt   DateTime         @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt   DateTime         @updatedAt      @map("updated_at")

  employee    Employee         @relation(fields: [employeeId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([employeeId, date])
  @@index([employeeId])
  @@index([date])
  @@map("attendance")
}

// ── Payroll ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
model Payroll {
  id              String        @id @default(uuid())
  employeeId      String        @map("employee_id")
  month           Int           // 1-12
  year            Int
  workingDays     Int           @map("working_days")
  presentDays     Int           @map("present_days")
  baseSalary      Decimal       @map("base_salary")     @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  earnedSalary    Decimal       @map("earned_salary")   @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  hra             Decimal       @default(0)              @db.Decimal(12, 2) // House Rent Allowance
  da              Decimal       @default(0)              @db.Decimal(12, 2) // Dearness Allowance
  conveyance      Decimal       @default(0)              @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  medicalAllowance Decimal      @default(0) @map("medical_allowance") @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  otherAllowances Decimal       @default(0) @map("other_allowances")  @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  grossSalary     Decimal       @map("gross_salary")    @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  pf              Decimal       @default(0)              @db.Decimal(12, 2) // Provident Fund
  esi             Decimal       @default(0)              @db.Decimal(12, 2) // Employee State Insurance
  professionalTax Decimal       @default(0) @map("professional_tax") @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  incomeTax       Decimal       @default(0) @map("income_tax")       @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  otherDeductions Decimal       @default(0) @map("other_deductions") @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  totalDeductions Decimal       @map("total_deductions") @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  netPay          Decimal       @map("net_pay")          @db.Decimal(12, 2)
  status          PayrollStatus @default(DRAFT)
  paidAt          DateTime?     @map("paid_at")
  createdAt       DateTime      @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt       DateTime      @updatedAt      @map("updated_at")

  employee        Employee      @relation(fields: [employeeId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([employeeId, month, year])
  @@index([employeeId])
  @@index([month, year])
  @@map("payrolls")
}

// ── Leave Balance ───────────────────────────────────────────────
model LeaveBalance {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  employeeId   String   @map("employee_id")
  year         Int
  totalLeaves  Int      @default(24) @map("total_leaves")
  usedLeaves   Int      @default(0)  @map("used_leaves")
  sickLeaves   Int      @default(12) @map("sick_leaves")
  casualLeaves Int      @default(12) @map("casual_leaves")
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt    DateTime @updatedAt      @map("updated_at")

  employee     Employee @relation(fields: [employeeId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([employeeId, year])
  @@map("leave_balances")
}

// ── Enums ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
enum Gender {
  MALE
  FEMALE
  OTHER
}

enum EmployeeRole {
  SUPER_ADMIN
  ADMIN
  HR_MANAGER
  MANAGER
  EMPLOYEE
}

enum AttendanceStatus {
  PRESENT
  ABSENT
  HALF_DAY
  LATE
  ON_LEAVE
  HOLIDAY
  WEEKEND
}

enum PayrollStatus {
  DRAFT
  PROCESSING
  APPROVED
  PAID
  CANCELLED
}
